^{:go/end 378} (go/method allocPages64 "allocPages64 allocates a 64-bit block of 64 pages aligned to 64 pages according\nto the bits set in alloc. The block set is the one containing the i'th page.\n" [^{:tag (* pallocBits)} b ^uint i ^uint64 alloc]
